	(text "THE OUT PORT: LATCH, EIGHT LEDS, TWO TIL311 HEX DISPLAYS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3e2505f4-b955-5bcb-8943-28166c95290a"))
	(text "U2 latches the OUT byte. The LEDs show it bit by bit (sourced through RN2, 1k x 8), U7 shows bits 7-4 and U8 bits 3-0 in\nhex (TIL311 strobe low = transparent, blanking low = on). TIL311 pinout as on Ken's YACC1 IO card." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "be6f7698-820b-5b01-88cb-7326188f6ecd"))
